spoiler":false,"text":"The rabbit always seen with Elric."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c110143"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cd/cd462bb86b43d67a8ad14c2e93c5dfb9d6b8ca2f86d241da137132aec4d636c4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e9/e9e84df7339b6dfd1dc665964b7deb2c5c1bc2961ca52d14cc27f24ff8fdd8ca.webp","width":228,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"長縄 まりあ","creatorId":"vndb:s2653","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2653","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2653","name":"長縄 まりあ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:67275","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c39721","characterName":"湊戸 アイ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c39721"},"originalCharacterName":"湊戸 アイ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"322"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist of the game. \"Beniyuri\" isn't her real name, but one of the \"nicknames\" she and the others each chose to use to refer to each other due their amnesiac state."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Even without her memories, Beniyuri is a kind, patient, well-mannered and optimistic girl, who is unable to abandon someone in trouble regardless of the danger. In that same regard, she can be quite stubborn at times and could come across as a bit of a busybody meddler. Still, even though she doesn't necessarily have a bad attitude, she holds a certain hesitance towards, and has a tendency to draw a line against developing a deeper relationship with other people."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from Otome Jikan."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c39721"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e9/e992bf93230b77ebdde2059c93d7c546ff420882b1073ea0f9b8a1d485a9e099.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/35/35b7a67f93cd4f4c78362288b6aeca35fc776d51c9b372856afbc214b5a67165.webp","width":200,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"中原 麻衣","creatorId":"vndb:s444","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s444","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s444","name":"中原 麻衣","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:67273","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c56350","characterName":"ジェド / エアル","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c56350"},"originalCharacterName":"ジェド / エアル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"17"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"‘I have no intention of commanding you to do anything. There’s just something I’d like to ask you.’"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The girl who possesses the ‘Witch’s Symbol’ — her right eye that glows red whenever her emotions grow too strong. In order to hide this, she lives in a tower away from the village as a man. She works as a handyman to make a living. As she is skilled in housework-related things, like cooking and cleaning, she’s often made to serve the lord of the tower."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Sakura52's blog"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c56350"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/95/956cff1bcf587cd9d4737914c9b2c3c968a1076744bb93a5f0d9359c8d1340f0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/42/429307449d91072fd2668b1bb10345f2a2f6f65019d5abb81c06534f5c071266.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"田村 睦心","creatorId":"vndb:s11724","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11724","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11724","name":"田村睦心","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:67280","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c56351","characterName":"塔の主","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c56351"},"originalCharacterName":"塔の主","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"‘There’s no need to be so reserved. We’re both men, after all. There’s no way I’d do anything underhanded.’"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The one-eyed man who lives with the heroine as the tower’s guardian. A mysterious figure who can erase his presence at will. He hates all troublesome things, and rarely appears in front of others. He willingly performs a spell to prevent Jed’s eye from glowing red, in which he kisses her right eyelid. He has no memories of his past."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Sakura52's blog"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c56351"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3e/3ec6dba95422639b39ccc4e3072897bc1149c248ce22570e1d210669b0f555bf.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/76/767b9cd37377daccb6521b9bbd3b3902d5da8ca4e9cf803197e4b30fcf75d17e.webp","width":201,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"平川 大輔","creatorId":"vndb:s133","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s133","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s133","name":"平川 大輔","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:67271","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c56352","characterName":"ラヴァン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c56352"},"originalCharacterName":"ラヴァン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"‘Geez, you’re really so…… I don’t what to do with myself when you say things like that.’"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A young man who is next in line to lead the Wolf family. He always chooses his actions while thinking of others, and is respected and loved by many. He is the leader of the vigilante that is made up of young men from the Wolf family. He is always a step ahead of the heroine, and is an older brother-like existence to her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Sakura52's blog"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c56352"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a8/a85d3acb4e239f5b7a0069e349649ffd98f0c8c53c4c62e1a1f3309922aec427.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dc/dc23b5747a58fe1088e1102cb4f67224b9652374fe62b9c0dd5e60795aef7def.webp","width":201,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"日野 聡","creatorId":"vndb:s82","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s82","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s82","name":"日野 聡","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:67269","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c56353","characterName":"レビ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c56353"},"originalCharacterName":"レビ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"'The son of a leader going out of his way to hurt commoners, huh. The Hawks must have a lot of time on their hands.’"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Son of the current leader of the Wolf family, and Lavan’s younger brother. He has a habit of running his mouth, but he is a cheerful young man who often helps his brother out. Though he thinks of the heroine as a younger brother, he’s often the one who ends up receiving advice from the heroine."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Sakura52's blog"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c56353"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/52/526af9b644dcbfa79e14b18c0a47fed3b874cbad451dab5c18f019199eb936d5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1c/1c532d9ca5d66634716ec9ec6387bc3074aa3168706e7b4810b9b03c3fe4c941.webp","width":201,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"斉藤 壮馬","creatorId":"vndb:s5499","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5499","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5499","name":"斉藤 壮馬","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:67277","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c56354","characterName":"ルーガス","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c56354"},"originalCharacterName":"ルーガス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"‘I won’t allow you to get in my way anymore than you already have. Now scram.’"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Son of the Hawk family’s leader. Due to his cold expression and how intense he is, many find it difficult to approach him. He deeply respects his father, Olgar, and assists him in his work. Though he is a leader to the young men in Hawk, he keeps his distance and mostly works on his own."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Sakura52's blog"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c56354"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bb/bbd692011c13df425e1bab52f75014be369d406135ece90e357a753a877498da.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b6/b61a39ccb654b5567cf5f1f5384444ef1c74cd4a9c4d8ad0fd3c16a7a7290779.webp","width":201,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"古川 慎","creatorId":"vndb:s7848","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7848","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7848","name":"古川 慎","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:67278","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c56355","characterName":"ヒュー","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c56355"},"originalCharacterName":"ヒュー","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"‘We’ll meet again. Surely, it won’t be long…’"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A mysterious young man who comes and disappears as he pleases. He seems to know a lot about the secrets of ‘a certain thing’; it’s unknown as to whether he is friend or foe."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Sakura52's blog"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c56355"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b4/b40e8880351682f43ef462648b77db8aa9202d42b3c8a2243ec669f568372feb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0a/0a98791644c56fb03d9ccec33af06c50f2a2b49f4848ffb0ed490ab3dee17dcb.webp","width":202,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"浪川 大輔","creatorId":"